{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:30 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:30 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:30 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"案發於隆亨邨。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/dc978c693780023f8874a2f94e033699/2026-10/page_179.jpg\"/><p>今日（22日）早上10時06分，沙田隆亨邨慧心樓一名住戶報案，指家中有金飾失竊，銀行戶口內亦有存款被轉走，懷疑是其外傭所為。警方到場調查，暫列作盜竊案件，具體損失有待點算。據了解，涉事外傭已經完約離職，警方正追查其下落。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:22:33.002943+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:30:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:18:08.813495+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:18:08.813495+00:00","content_hash":"2e15c706b52f3a4a3786012d31316dd8493d9b26b1edbe61b7d73872e5c05dc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}